    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d512">

                <pb facs="0723" n="635" xml:id="pg635"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Foster to Mr. Scruggs.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1892-10-12"><hi rendition="#italic">October 12,
                        1892</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Foster directs Mr. Scruggs to recognize the new government, provided it is
                    accepted by the people in possession of the power of the nation and fully
                    established; he asks to be informed of action taken.</p>
            </div>
